":199,"_183":200,"_185":201,"_187":202,"_189":203,"_191":204,"_193":196,"_195":196},{"_178":179,"_55":180,"_181":182,"_183":184,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_189":190,"_191":192,"_193":194,"_195":196},"itemId","k8d2s2ywds1oilbpti5ie2vt9","Pen Test Partners 分析 RDM 制冷控制器漏洞及英国超市暴露风险","summary","Pen Test Partners 与 Omega Solutions 分析并验证 RDM 制冷控制器中的多个漏洞，揭示英国多家超市、零售商和冷链运营商存在公网暴露风险。","sourceName","Pen Test Partners","sourceUrl","https://www.pentestpartners.com/security-blog/the-fridge-hack-uk-supermarkets-narrowly-avoided/","publishedAt","2026-11-20T00:01:00.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/a97df3c2ea7dd63b.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/b0ba2c2b5c65cef0.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/a97df3c2ea7dd63b.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"ql8z19mw87u0y7njlw1p4sq74","Contao core-bundle 漏洞分析：theme_import 权限可绕过 tpl_editor 限制实现 RCE","Contao core-bundle 存在权限提升漏洞，受委托的用户或用户组管理员可为自己或所管理的账户添加 theme_import 权限，进而在服务器上执行任意 PHP。","GitHub 安全公告","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-r9qp-pqx5-8369","2026-11-20T23:45:41.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f426f4f60d806c23.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp 96w","cxkvmlklv6c39ftnl61m71q1k","pREST _groupby 函数表达式 SQL 注入分析，CVE-2025-58450 修复不完整","pREST 的 _groupby 函数表达式路径仍可触发 SQL 注入，构成 CVE-2025-58450 后续修复的不完整覆盖。作者以负向对照测试确认，isSafeSQLExpression 会错误接受 4 类包含 UNION、子查询或 pg_sleep 的 Payload，并由 GroupByClause 原样拼接执行；默认配置下仅需表读取权限，可能无需认证。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-v9v2-98xq-627c","2026-11-20T14:41:42.000Z","b7fagpjz2rm06udejoz3syyf2","Cisco 排查 nginx 远程代码执行漏洞对产品的影响","Cisco PSIRT 通报 nginx 1.9.5 至 1.31.8 存在多个可能导致远程代码执行的严重漏洞，已在 1.31.9 和 1.30.7 修复，涉及 CVE-2026-113425、CVE-2026-121810、CVE-2026-123007、CVE-2026-123633、CVE-2026-123634。","Cisco PSIRT","https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-nginx-nov-2026-e8jska2s?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20nginx%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20November%202026%26vs_k=1","2026-11-20T08:00:00.000Z","x7ycqidb5r6kh03f3x4mdp7je","Chrome 157.0.8103.38 修复 CVE-2026-121104 目录授权漏洞","CVE-2026-121104 影响 Chrome 的 File System API 敏感路径拦截机制，旧版规则未覆盖多个平台上的 ~/.cache，恶意页面诱导用户通过 showDirectoryPicker() 授权目录后即可读写该路径并执行代码。","先知社区","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93396","2026-11-18T18:36:05.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fxz.aliyun.com%2Ffavicon.ico&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=862a26438132b835 48w, /dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp 96w","f21gd7uj9jttjkqd3djp2u7i7","欧盟委员会遭 ARTEX AI 辅助攻击，人事管理系统中断至少 10 天","欧盟官员证实，欧盟委员会遭 AI 辅助网络攻击，10 月 22 日发现事件后关闭多个应用，翻译、费用报销、薪资和工时记录等系统受到影响，至少 10 天无法正常提供服务，部分数字工具持续离线。","安全内参","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4NDY2MDMwMw==&mid=2247516927&idx=1&sn=eef26e1f7857fef09b3352a6224c3796","2026-11-20T10:12:00.000Z","sn5s06akig7th3wj4puzg5tfh","GhostMap eBPF Rootkit 深度分析：隐匿 npm IronWorm 与 AUR Atomic Arch 攻击活动","Aqua Nautilus 在 IronWorm 与 Atomic Arch 两起供应链攻击载荷中发现同一个 eBPF Rootkit 组件 GhostMap，并确认其由 13 个 eBPF 程序、10 个 map、13 个 link 构成。","奇安信威胁情报中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521462&idx=2&sn=658b0b589425488dda58a7b36d7344d8","2026-11-20T04:07:00.000Z","z7hvv6ys0av1dleklhpjcsukl","Refitter 2.0.0 存在 OpenAPI 路径注入导致的 RCE","Refitter 2.0.0 在 .NET 8 下存在由恶意 OpenAPI 路径触发的 RCE。未转义的路径可注入 `[ModuleInitializer]`，生成的客户端被编译并加载时，攻击代码会在应用启动阶段执行，无需 `--skip-validation`。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-3fhm-p725-h3g3","2026-11-20T00:06:04.000Z","sgciwtig86m8ho71b0h3a56f6","VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 通告，官方已发布修复","深瞳漏洞实验室于2026年11月20日发布漏洞通告，VMware vCenter 存在认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890，威胁等级为高危。","深信服千里目安全实验室","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2NjgzNjA5NQ==&mid=2247526537&idx=2&sn=57ef0f46346644211dab70cf3c236d11","2026-11-20T09:49:00.000Z","otherSources","related",[251],"followUp",{"_178":252,"_55":253,"_181":-5,"_183":254,"_185":255,"_187":256,"_189":257,"_191":258,"_193":196,"_195":196},"sjin4pr8q1dp00z0igue1371g","CISA将4个漏洞纳入KEV Catalog，均有真实利用证据","CISA 安全公告","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2026/11/20/cisa-adds-four-known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog","2026-11-20T12:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/c65213b8bb0b8c32.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f4741f74a4c97912.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/c65213b8bb0b8c32.webp 96w","t8wmzmfpiiphjiwm2e8ngw49n","OpenJDK CVE-2026-114938 AVX-512 越界写利用链与复现","OpenJDK CVE-2026-114938 可由 Base64 解码的 AVX-512 尾部路径整数下溢引发堆越界写，作者在 Temurin 21.0.13+9 上验证固定越界 62 字节，并完成堆内读写、任意原生读写、ASLR 绕过、桩槽覆写到命令执行。","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93395","2026-11-19T05:08:10.000Z",{"_266":307,"_181":-5,"_268":308},{"_266":267,"_181":-5,"_268":269},"label","攻击与威胁","items",[270,271,272,273,274],{"_178":302,"_55":303,"_181":304,"_183":285,"_185":305,"_187":306,"_189":288,"_191":289,"_193":194,"_195":196,"_247":48},{"_178":298,"_55":299,"_181":300,"_183":233,"_185":301,"_187":235,"_189":-5,"_193":194,"_195":196},{"_178":290,"_55":291,"_181":292,"_183":293,"_185":294,"_187":295,"_189":296,"_191":297,"_193":194,"_195":196},{"_178":282,"_55":283,"_181":284,"_183":285,"_185":286,"_187":287,"_189":288,"_191":289,"_193":194,"_195":196},{"_178":275,"_55":276,"_181":277,"_183":227,"_185":278,"_187":279,"_189":280,"_191":281,"_193":194,"_195":196},"a5t4y4pmj5g2r43vgy8qp8hnx","“银狐”网络攻击活动利用VPN客户端安装包传播Windows木马","国家计算机病毒应急处理中心连续发现多个面向Windows用户的恶意VPN客户端软件安装包，感染后会分阶段释放载荷并加载远程控制功能。攻击者通过搜索引擎结果投毒推广钓鱼网站，诱导下载含木马的“免费VPN”“VPN加速”等安装包；感染后可能冒充用户联系亲友实施诈骗，并可能投送勒索病毒。网络管理员可依据附件1特征开展针对性排查，来源不明文件可在国家计算机病毒协同分析平台检测。","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95819","2026-11-20T01:16:36.512Z","/dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3399ea7b18d18a6a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp 96w","hikp8skmkm0icifdlk2ddmxo6","n0n 勒索 Qubole 后声称泄露 Chase、Visa 和 Mastercard 客户数据","n0n 勒索组织声称攻击云数据分析公司 Qubole，并在 2026 年 10 月 14 日至 26 日间利用已泄露的 Qubole 凭据，经客户配置的 IAM roles 入侵 AWS 环境，窃取 53.9 GB、30,743 个文件，并声称掌握近 1 PB 客户网络数据。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/vendor-data-breach-exposes-chase-visa-mastercard-customer-info/","2026-11-20T15:58:06.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","y1q31smahyra1wu2i286xr7ey","Unit 42披露Com关联组织以语音钓鱼窃取数据并实施勒索","Unit 42追踪到Bling Libra及多个Com关联活动簇通过语音钓鱼和AiTM页面窃取凭据与MFA批准，随后借助原生云工具、脚本和恶意浏览器扩展定位高价值数据、批量外传并发送勒索信息。","Unit 42","https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/com-affiliate-vishing-attacks/","2026-11-20T22:00:25.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c5c35eb93d4d2e80.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/4d373ddb2d54a219.webp 96w","do1qix3duahy7w828dz52wk6y","BlackNevas 利用合法 vCenter 管理接口破坏 VMware 虚拟化环境","BlackNevas 通过组织内部获取的凭据进入 VCSA，建立 MeshAgent 与 Ligolo-ng 持久化通道，滥用 vCenter Host Profiles 开启 TSM-SSH，再经 SFTP 向 ESXi 投递加密器；事件导致四台 ESXi 主机及其全部虚拟机、两台 VCSA 和备份基础设施被破坏。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521462&idx=1&sn=4255628f912af9993074bd11dcb83a80","mfif5csbm0luk6anr64r4hzho","攻击者利用自主 AI 工具 Cairn 攻陷 MONAI Label 漏洞并取得服务器权限","Amazon Threat Intelligence 发现疑似中国关联攻击者使用自主 AI Agent 平台 Cairn，于 2026 年 9 月 8 日至 10 日攻击中国境外东亚教育机构。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/hackers-use-autonomous-ai-tool-cairn-to-find-zero-day-take-over-server/","2026-11-20T17:30:00.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[309,310,311,312,313,314,315],{"_178":142,"_55":116,"_181":366,"_183":367,"_185":368,"_187":369,"_189":-5,"_193":196,"_195":196},{"_178":356,"_55":357,"_181":358,"_183":244,"_185":359,"_187":246,"_189":-5,"_193":196,"_195":196,"_247":50,"_248":360},{"_178":352,"_55":353,"_181":354,"_183":244,"_185":355,"_187":246,"_189":-5,"_193":196,"_195":196},{"_178":347,"_55":348,"_181":349,"_183":200,"_185":350,"_187":351,"_189":203,"_191":204,"_193":196,"_195":196},{"_178":342,"_55":343,"_181":344,"_183":200,"_185":345,"_187":346,"_189":203,"_191":204,"_193":196,"_195":196},{"_178":337,"_55":338,"_181":339,"_183":327,"_185":340,"_187":341,"_189":330,"_191":331,"_193":194,"_195":196},{"_178":316,"_55":317,"_181":318,"_183":319,"_185":320,"_187":321,"_189":-5,"_193":196,"_195":196,"_247":52,"_248":322},"zskyo0v1efsw8awv3dpq9z9qp","PHP 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-126714 已发布补丁","PHP files 会话保存处理器存在反序列化远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-126714，CVSS 4.0 分数为 9.2。攻击者需影响目标会话内容、在写入时制造中断，并找到应用中的反序列化 gadget chain；Redis、数据库等非文件后端不受影响。","奇安信 CERT","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NDgxODU1MQ==&mid=2247508191&idx=1&sn=81fa4f829d3bd2e4d52b367892eecc42","2026-11-19T17:25:00.000Z",[323,324],{"_178":332,"_55":333,"_181":-5,"_183":334,"_185":335,"_187":336,"_189":-5,"_193":196,"_195":196},{"_178":325,"_55":326,"_181":-5,"_183":327,"_185":328,"_187":329,"_189":330,"_191":331,"_193":194,"_195":196},"xc4re3fqbv7j3asqraazbq4h2","PHP phpAfterShell 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-126714 已修复，Cloudflare WAF 已更新检测","Cloudflare Blog","https://blog.cloudflare.com/phpaftershell-waf-protection/","2026-11-20T20:00:45.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/e0511aa52e58d477.webp","/dailyinfo/media/20e3fb0c4cf82a1a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/e0511aa52e58d477.webp 96w","ove2pi7map5xlnn8tjm9w03ev","PHP 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-126714 已公开并发布修复","绿盟科技CERT","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0MjE3ODkxNg==&mid=2247494212&idx=1&sn=6a538230b1fa15acf64d2d18135d0026","2026-11-20T03:35:00.000Z","zp8d6zx3kkva6gw0b0abpm2pv","nginx 披露五项内存破坏漏洞 CVE-2026-123007 等，Cloudflare 分析代理防护边界","F5 与 nginx.org 披露五项 nginx 内存破坏漏洞，未认证攻击者在特定配置下可导致 worker 崩溃，并在禁用或绕过 ASLR 时执行服务器命令；Xint 还发现可由 Docker 容器内提权至宿主机 root 的 Linux SCTP use-after-free。","https://blog.cloudflare.com/nginx2root/","2026-11-20T01:58:29.000Z","o8h8pr20nka4isxskyxhrhckz","Etherpad /static/* 路径遍历漏洞可未认证读取任意文件并提升至 RCE","Etherpad 的 /static/* 处理器存在未认证路径遍历漏洞，远程用户无需凭据即可读取 Etherpad 进程有权访问的任意文件。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mc8w-wjhw-45x5","2026-11-20T00:23:45.000Z","lma026dsgiyjnyodlwboyhmxp","Daptin 通用 YJS 协作端点存在 IDOR 漏洞，未授权用户可读写文件内容","Daptin 的通用 YJS 协作端点 `GET /yjs/:documentName` 仅校验会话存在，未执行行级或列级授权检查，任何已注册用户包括零权限账户均可读取并修改任意表的 `file.*` 类型列内容，包括默认仅限管理员访问的 `calendar` 表。","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-wj7x-58c2-5793","2026-11-20T00:14:14.000Z","d8r57wa5dx4heczan7q6hz8i5","PHP 8.2至8.5系列曝出7个代码执行漏洞，官方已发布修复版本","深瞳漏洞实验室披露PHP组件7个严重代码执行漏洞，分别为CVE-2026-126714、CVE-2026-115560、CVE-2026-129289、CVE-2026-129474、CVE-2026-129496、CVE-2026-129182和CVE-2026-129481。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2NjgzNjA5NQ==&mid=2247526537&idx=1&sn=c9538af4fae785647a200693d9a3f900","rv2ecm55xe5ces92lza6gmsz6","Ruby 字符串大小写转换堆越界写入漏洞 CVE-2026-132825 存在 RCE 风险","Ruby 字符串大小写转换函数存在堆缓冲区越界写入漏洞（CVE-2026-132825），影响 Ruby < 3.3.14、Ruby 3.4.0 - 3.4.12 和 Ruby 4.0.0 - 4.0.9，威胁等级为高危。","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2NjgzNjA5NQ==&mid=2247526537&idx=3&sn=d3994fc9cd73ceb292a7ed2a9d6f65f6",[361],{"_178":362,"_55":363,"_181":-5,"_183":327,"_185":364,"_187":365,"_189":330,"_191":331,"_193":194,"_195":196},"jszry2ckucax402ve9a7rmc3m","Cloudflare WAF 防护 ruby2shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-132825 及 GHSA-87fm-7w84-j2px","https://blog.cloudflare.com/ruby2shell-waf-protection/","2026-11-20T20:24:38.000Z","Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已遭在野利用，攻击者可投递特制 .ics 日历文件诱使用户打开或导入，借此向攻击者控制的网络位置发起认证并泄露当前用户的 NTLMv2 响应；利用可远程触发，无需权限，但需要用户配合。","微步在线研究响应中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MTc3ODY4Mw==&mid=2247509077&idx=3&sn=fc17281daf783d776f4c2748ce5df332","2026-11-19T17:06:00.000Z",{"_178":356,"_55":357,"_181":358,"_183":244,"_185":359,"_187":246,"_189":-5,"_193":196,"_195":196,"_247":50,"_248":373},{"_178":302,"_55":303,"_181":304,"_183":285,"_185":305,"_187":306,"_189":288,"_191":289,"_193":194,"_195":196,"_247":48},{"_178":298,"_55":299,"_181":300,"_183":233,"_185":301,"_187":235,"_189":-5,"_193":194,"_195":196},[374],{"_178":362,"_55":363,"_181":-5,"_183":327,"_185":364,"_187":365,"_189":330,"_191":331,"_193":194,"_195":196},"leadParagraph",{"_377":378,"_379":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
